# Replies built from parts, for the reply pools the month simulation found most used (UT_ChatMonth, 2026-10-26: about
# 1,600 "chat" replies a month from 56 lines once the new openers were in). Every way of saying a line must fit ANY
# opener of its type. "[a|b]" parts are expanded by build_corpus.py.

# ---- chat: a light reaction to an observation -----------------------------------------------
@kind reply
@answers chat
@who *
[heh|ha|hah], [so true|too true|true enough|very true]
[yeah|yep|yup], [i noticed that too|noticed the same|saw that as well]
[thats|that is] [so|very|pretty] [true|accurate|on the nose][ lol|]
[ha|heh], [cant argue with|no arguing with|wont argue with] that
[same|same here|me too][, every time|, all the time|, always]
[i know|i know right|tell me about it][, it never changes|, every single night|]
[ha|heh] [you said it|well said|you nailed it]
[cant say|wont say] [i disagree|youre wrong|otherwise]
[yeah|yep] [thats|that is] [about right|how it goes|the way of it]
[i was|i was just] [thinking|saying] [the same thing|that earlier|that yesterday]
[ha|heh|lol] [yes|yep], [exactly that|this exactly|exactly]
[fair|good|solid] [point|observation|call]
[thats|that is] [a good one|so real|very real][ heh|]
[oh|ah] [i know the feeling|know that feeling|i know that one]
[hah|heh], [been there|seen that|lived that][, many times|, more than once|]
[huh|hm], [never noticed|didnt notice|hadnt noticed] [but you are right|but yeah|but true]
[pretty much|basically|more or less][, yeah|, yep|]
[mm|mhm], [agreed|same|true]
[yeah|yep] [its|it is] [like that|always like that|like that every time]
[makes|that makes] [sense|perfect sense|total sense][ to me|]
[ha|heh], [thats|that is] [the realm in a nutshell|the game in a nutshell|life out here]
[oh yeah|oh for sure|for sure][, same|, me too|, every time]
[heh|ha], [you and everyone else|you are not alone|not just you]
[good|nice] [to hear|to know][, ty|, thanks|]
[ha|heh], [i like that|love that|thats great]
@who Socialite
[aw|oh] [i love that|thats lovely|thats sweet][!|, really|]
@who NoLifer
[yep|mhm][, seen it|, old news|, every night][. back to it|. anyway|]
@who Explorer
[heh|ha], [the little things|its the little things] [out here|in this game|in the realm]
@who Daredevil
[ha|heh], [sounds|that sounds] like [a good time|my kind of night|fun]
@who Crafter
[heh|ha], [same at the forge|same with crafting|crafting is the same]
@who Leveler
[yep|true][, anyway|. ok], [back to the grind|back to it|xp waits]

# ---- lfg: someone looking for a group (never claim to invite) -----------------------------
@kind reply
@answers lfg
@who *
[gl|good luck][, should be easy|, someone will bite|, hope you find one][ to find one|]
[gl|good luck][, its|, it is] [busy|pretty busy|quiet|slow] [right now|at the moment][ though|]
[what|which] [camp|zone|dungeon] [you after|you looking at|you thinking][?|, xp or loot?]
[keep|just keep] [asking|at it][, someone|, a group] will [want|need] [you|a {class}]
[gl|good luck], [i|] [would join|would group] but [im|i am] [busy|in the middle of something]
@needs solo
[same|same here], [lf group|lfg] [too|as well][, if you form one say so|]
@needs in_group
[our|my] group [is full|has no room][, sorry|, gl though]

# ---- trade: someone buying or selling ---------------------------------------------------------
@kind reply
@answers trade
@who *
[gl selling|good luck selling][ that|][, someone will want it|]
[how much|what price][ for it|][?|, roughly?]
[try|check] the [exchange|broker][, prices are fair|, people buy there|]
[nice|good] [stuff|item][, gl with it|, hope it sells|]
[not for my class|cant use it][, sorry|, gl though]
[might|maybe ill] [look|check it out] [later|after this camp]
